---
import Layout from '../layouts/layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Kahane Coaching" description="Christine Kahane, NBC-HWC — Executive, Health & Wellness, and Divorce Coaching grounded in 25 years of communication science and emotional intelligence.">

  <!-- ============================================================
       HERO
       ============================================================ -->
  <section class="hero">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="hero-grid">

        <!-- Left: copy -->
        <div class="hero-left">
          <span class="eyebrow">Community of Practice</span>
          <h1 class="hero-title">Unlearn.<br><em>Lead with Genius.</em></h1>
          <p class="hero-subhead">A space where individual leaders discover their innate brilliance through science-backed facilitation.</p>
          <p class="hero-body">Most leadership development focuses on what you do. Kahane Coaching focuses on how you are — under load, under scrutiny, and in the moments that matter most. The work is precise, confidential, and grounded in the same structural framework that underlies the Coherence ecosystem.</p>
          <div class="hero-actions">
            <a href="/contact" class="btn-primary">Start a Conversation</a>
            <a href="#approach" class="btn-ghost">Explore the Approach →</a>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Right: Christine card -->
        <div class="hero-right">
          <div class="christine-card">
            <div class="christine-name">Christine Kahane, NBC-HWC</div>
            <span class="christine-credentials">NBC-HWC &nbsp;·&nbsp; MCWC &nbsp;·&nbsp; TIPF</span>
            <p class="christine-bio">25+ years of experience in communication science and emotional intelligence. Christine works with individual leaders navigating the intersection of performance, identity, and organizational pressure.</p>
            <div class="christine-divider"></div>
            <span class="focus-label">Areas of focus</span>
            <div class="focus-item">Leadership presence under pressure</div>
            <div class="focus-item">Behavioral and attentional recalibration</div>
            <div class="focus-item">Executive identity and transition</div>
            <div class="focus-item">Somatic regulation for high-performance</div>
          </div>
        </div>

      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ============================================================
       APPROACH
       ============================================================ -->
  <section class="section-approach" id="approach">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="approach-grid">

        <div class="approach-left">
          <span class="eyebrow">How the Work Happens</span>
          <div class="section-rule"></div>
          <h2 class="section-title">Not skill-building.<br>Pattern recognition.</h2>
          <p class="section-sub">The behaviors that limit leaders under pressure are structural — not personal failures. Naming the pattern is the first act of change.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="approach-right">
          <div class="approach-item fade-up">
            <span class="approach-num">01</span>
            <h3 class="approach-title">Diagnostic Entry</h3>
            <p class="approach-body">Every engagement begins with the Essential Coherence Diagnostic — a structured instrument that identifies the patterns shaping how you process signals, decisions, and pressure. The results inform everything that follows.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="approach-item fade-up">
            <span class="approach-num">02</span>
            <h3 class="approach-title">Leadership Coherence Debrief</h3>
            <p class="approach-body">A 30-minute structured debrief with Christine translates your diagnostic results into the specific conditions shaping your leadership. This is not a sales conversation. It is a calibrated reading of your results in context.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="approach-item fade-up">
            <span class="approach-num">03</span>
            <h3 class="approach-title">Sustained Coaching Engagement</h3>
            <p class="approach-body">For leaders ready to go deeper — a sustained engagement working across behavioral, relational, and attentional dimensions. Calibrated to your diagnostic results and the specific demands of your leadership context.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="approach-item fade-up">
            <span class="approach-num">04</span>
            <h3 class="approach-title">Confidentiality</h3>
            <p class="approach-body">Everything stays in the room. Under NBHWC ethical standards, all coaching conversations are completely confidential. Christine never references specific client situations, challenges, or data in any public context.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ============================================================
       PULLQUOTE
       ============================================================ -->
  <section class="section-quote">
    <div class="pullquote-inner">
      <div class="pullquote-mark">"</div>
      <p class="pullquote-text">Most leadership problems are not personal failures. They are structural reflexes. And structural reflexes change when the structure changes.</p>
      <span class="pullquote-attr">Christine Kahane &nbsp;·&nbsp; Founder, Kahane Coaching</span>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ============================================================
       ENTRY POINTS
       ============================================================ -->
  <section class="section-entry">
    <div class="container">
      <span class="eyebrow">Where to Begin</span>
      <div class="section-rule"></div>
      <h2 class="section-title">There is a structured place to start,<br>wherever you are in the process.</h2>
      <div class="entry-grid">

        <div class="entry-card fade-up">
          <div class="entry-header">
            <span class="entry-num">01</span>
            <span class="entry-price">$395</span>
          </div>
          <h3 class="entry-title">Essential Coherence Diagnostic</h3>
          <p class="entry-body">A structured 20-question diagnostic that identifies how pressure is moving through your leadership system. Produces a four-page report and includes a 30-minute debrief with Christine.</p>
          <a href="/diagnostic" class="entry-cta">Begin the Diagnostic →</a>
        </div>

        <div class="entry-card entry-card--featured fade-up">
          <div class="entry-header">
            <span class="entry-num">02</span>
            <span class="entry-price">Proposal-based</span>
          </div>
          <h3 class="entry-title">Individual Coaching Engagement</h3>
          <p class="entry-body">Sustained coaching across behavioral, relational, and attentional dimensions. Calibrated to your diagnostic results and the specific demands of your leadership context.</p>
          <a href="/contact" class="entry-cta">Start a Conversation →</a>
        </div>

        <div class="entry-card fade-up">
          <div class="entry-header">
            <span class="entry-num">03</span>
            <span class="entry-price">Free</span>
          </div>
          <h3 class="entry-title">The Coherence Canvas</h3>
          <p class="entry-body">A public interactive tool for mapping how your system responds to pressure. Built for orientation — a starting point before the diagnostic or a way to explore the framework on your own terms.</p>
          <a href="https://coherence-company.vercel.app/coherence-canvas" class="entry-cta">Explore the Canvas →</a>
        </div>

      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

</Layout>

<style>
  /* ============================================================
     TOKEN ALIASES — local shorthand matching the mockup's vars
     ============================================================ */
  :root {
    --gold:       #C4922A;
    --gold-light: #D4A84B;
    --silver:     #8C9490;

    /* page backgrounds */
    --limestone:    #EEF2F1;
    --warm-white:   #F4F7F6;
    --warm-white-2: #EFF3F2;

    --body-color:  #2C3A4A;
    --muted:       #5C7068;
    --divider:     rgba(24, 51, 47, 0.1);

    /* Kahane green */
    --green:     #18332F;
    --green-mid: #1f4038;
  }

  /* ============================================================
     TYPOGRAPHY OVERRIDES
     Body copy: Playfair (from Layout global)
     Structural/UI elements: DM Sans
     ============================================================ */

  /* Elements that should be DM Sans (UI / labels / nav) */
  .eyebrow,
  .section-rule,
  .approach-num,
  .entry-num,
  .entry-price,
  .entry-cta,
  .focus-label,
  .christine-credentials,
  .pullquote-attr,
  .btn-primary,
  .btn-ghost {
    font-family: 'DM Sans', system-ui, sans-serif;
  }

  /* ============================================================
     LAYOUT
     ============================================================ */
  .container {
    max-width: 1200px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 0 2.5rem;
  }

  /* ============================================================
     SHARED COMPONENTS
     ============================================================ */
  .eyebrow {
    display: block;
    font-size: 0.6rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: 0.2em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--gold);
    margin-bottom: 1.25rem;
  }

  .section-rule {
    width: 40px;
    height: 2px;
    background: var(--gold);
    margin-bottom: 2rem;
  }

  .btn-primary {
    font-size: 0.65rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 0.12em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: #fff;
    background: var(--green);
    padding: 0.9rem 1.75rem;
    text-decoration: none;
    transition: background 0.2s;
    display: inline-block;
  }
  .btn-primary:hover { background: var(--green-mid); color: #fff; }

  .btn-ghost {
    font-size: 0.65rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: 0.1em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--green);
    text-decoration: none;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--green);
    padding-bottom: 2px;
    transition: color 0.2s, border-color 0.2s;
  }
  .btn-ghost:hover { color: var(--gold); border-color: var(--gold); }

  /* ============================================================
     HERO
     ============================================================ */
  .hero {
    background: var(--limestone);
    padding: 100px 0 90px;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--divider);
  }

  .hero-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1.1fr 1fr;
    gap: 5rem;
    align-items: center;
  }

  /* Eyebrow repurposed as subtitle */
  .hero .eyebrow {
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
  }

  .hero-title {
    font-family: 'Playfair Display', Georgia, serif;
    font-size: clamp(2.6rem, 5vw, 4.2rem);
    font-weight: 900;
    color: var(--green);
    line-height: 1.1;
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
  }
  .hero-title em {
    font-style: italic;
    font-weight: 700;
  }

  .hero-subhead {
    font-family: 'Playfair Display', Georgia, serif;
    font-size: clamp(1rem, 1.8vw, 1.3rem);
    font-weight: 400;
    font-style: italic;
    color: var(--green-mid);
    line-height: 1.6;
    margin-bottom: 2rem;
    opacity: 0.85;
  }

  .hero-body {
    font-family: 'Playfair Display', Georgia, serif;
    font-size: 0.97rem;
    color: var(--muted);
    line-height: 1.9;
    margin-bottom: 2.5rem;
  }

  .hero-actions {
    display: flex;
    gap: 1rem;
    align-items: center;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
  }

  /* Christine card */
  .christine-card {
    background: #fff;
    border: 0.5px solid var(--divider);
    border-top: 8px solid var(--gold);
    padding: 2.5rem;
  }

  .christine-name {
    font-family: 'Playfair Display', Georgia, serif;
    font-size: 1.4rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--green);
    margin-bottom: 0.3rem;
  }

  .christine-credentials {
    font-size: 0.68rem;
    color: var(--gold);
    letter-spacing: 0.1em;
    font-weight: 600;
    margin-bottom: 1.25rem;
    display: block;
  }

  .christine-bio {
    font-family: 'Playfair Display', Georgia, serif;
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    color: var(--muted);
    line-height: 1.9;
    margin-bottom: 1.25rem;
  }

  .christine-divider {
    height: 1px;
    background: var(--divider);
    margin: 1.25rem 0;
  }

  .focus-label {
    font-size: 0.55rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 0.16em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--silver);
    margin-bottom: 0.6rem;
    display: block;
  }

  .focus-item {
    font-family: 'Playfair Display', Georgia, serif;
    font-size: 0.82rem;
    color: var(--body-color);
    padding: 0.4rem 0;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--divider);
    line-height: 1.5;
  }
  .focus-item:last-child { border-bottom: none; }

  /* ============================================================
     APPROACH
     ============================================================ */
  .section-approach {
    background: var(--warm-white);
    padding: 100px 0;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--divider);
  }

  .approach-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1.5fr;
    gap: 6rem;
    align-items: start;
  }

  .approach-left {
    position: sticky;
    top: 80px;
  }

  .section-title {
    font-family: 'Playfair Display', Georgia, serif;
    font-size: clamp(1.5rem, 2.8vw, 2.1rem);
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--green);
    line-height: 1.25;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }

  .section-sub {
    font-family: 'Playfair Display', Georgia, serif;
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    color: var(--muted);
    line-height: 1.9;
    margin-top: 1rem;
  }

  .approach-item {
    padding: 1.75rem 0;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--divider);
  }
  .approach-item:first-child { border-top: 1px solid var(--divider); }

  .approach-num {
    font-size: 0.55rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 0.16em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--gold);
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
    display: block;
  }

  .approach-title {
    font-family: 'Playfair Display', Georgia, serif;
    font-size: 1.05rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--green);
    margin-bottom: 0.6rem;
    line-height: 1.35;
  }

  .approach-body {
    font-family: 'Playfair Display', Georgia, serif;
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    color: var(--muted);
    line-height: 1.9;
  }

  /* ============================================================
     PULLQUOTE
     ============================================================ */
  .section-quote {
    background: var(--warm-white-2);
    padding: 80px 0;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--divider);
  }

  .pullquote-inner {
    max-width: 700px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 0 2.5rem;
    text-align: center;
  }

  .pullquote-mark {
    font-family: 'Playfair Display', Georgia, serif;
    font-size: 5rem;
    color: var(--green);
    opacity: 0.12;
    line-height: 1;
    margin-bottom: -1.5rem;
  }

  .pullquote-text {
    font-family: 'Playfair Display', Georgia, serif;
    font-size: clamp(1.2rem, 2.5vw, 1.7rem);
    font-style: italic;
    color: var(--green);
    line-height: 1.6;
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
  }

  .pullquote-attr {
    font-size: 0.68rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: 0.12em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--gold);
  }

  /* ============================================================
     ENTRY POINTS
     ============================================================ */
  .section-entry {
    background: var(--warm-white);
    padding: 100px 0;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--divider);
  }

  .section-entry .section-title {
    margin-bottom: 0;
  }

  .entry-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
    gap: 0;
    border: 0.5px solid var(--divider);
    margin-top: 3rem;
  }

  .entry-card {
    padding: 2.25rem;
    border-right: 0.5px solid var(--divider);
    background: #fff;
    transition: background 0.2s;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
  }
  .entry-card:last-child { border-right: none; }
  .entry-card:hover { background: var(--limestone); }
  .entry-card--featured { border-top: 2px solid var(--green); }

  .entry-header {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: center;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }

  .entry-num {
    font-size: 0.55rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 0.16em;
    color: var(--gold);
  }

  .entry-price {
    font-size: 0.72rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--green);
  }

  .entry-title {
    font-family: 'Playfair Display', Georgia, serif;
    font-size: 1rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--green);
    line-height: 1.3;
    margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
  }

  .entry-body {
    font-family: 'Playfair Display', Georgia, serif;
    font-size: 0.84rem;
    color: var(--muted);
    line-height: 1.85;
    flex: 1;
    margin-bottom: 1.25rem;
  }

  .entry-cta {
    font-size: 0.62rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 0.1em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--green);
    text-decoration: none;
    border-top: 0.5px solid var(--divider);
    padding-top: 1rem;
    transition: color 0.2s;
    display: block;
  }
  .entry-cta:hover { color: var(--gold); }

  /* ============================================================
     RESPONSIVE
     ============================================================ */
  @media (max-width: 900px) {
    .hero { padding: 60px 0 50px; }
    .hero-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 3rem; }
    .approach-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 2.5rem; }
    .approach-left { position: static; }
    .entry-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    .entry-card { border-right: none; border-bottom: 0.5px solid var(--divider); }
    .entry-card:last-child { border-bottom: none; }
    .section-approach,
    .section-entry,
    .section-quote { padding: 60px 0; }
    .container { padding: 0 1.5rem; }
  }

  @media (max-width: 560px) {
    .hero-actions { flex-direction: column; align-items: flex-start; }
    .pullquote-inner { padding: 0 1.25rem; }
  }
</style>